v 3
d fixencoding: Character Encoding Conversion Utility
d
d Distribution-Date: 20251207
d
d A robust wrapper around Stata's unicode translate command that enables
d batch processing of multiple .dta files with a single command. Version 3.0
d includes enhanced error handling, backup functionality, dry-run mode,
d verbose output, and programmatic access via stored results.
d
d Features:
d   - Batch processing with wildcard support
d   - Automatic backup before conversion
d   - Dry-run mode to preview changes
d   - Detailed progress reporting
d   - Stored results for programmatic use
d
d Author: Multiple contributors
d Support: https://github.com/MaykolMedrano/fixencoding
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 or higher
d
f fixencoding.ado
f fixencoding.sthlp
